SUMMARY: Auditions for Quarryland Men's Chorus 25th Anniversary Season
DESCRIPTION:QMC is pleased to offer an opportunity to belong in our music
 al community! No preparation is required to audition\; this will be a sim
 ple process to place your voice and talents among our limited available s
 pots. Audition sessions are available each Monday in August from 6-7pm at
  First United Church\, 2420 E 3rd St\, Bloomington\, Indiana. (This churc
 h is an affirming and welcoming space for LGBTQ+ people\, and it’s the re
 hearsal home for Quarryland\, every Monday from 7-9:30pm.) While we are k
 nown as the Quarryland Men’s Chorus\, we welcome all gender expressions a
 nd orientations\, but we do perform music expressly composed or arranged 
 for tenor\, baritone\, and bass voices. More information at http://quarry
 land.org/about
CATEGORIES:Bloomington,Music,Audition,Sing
