DESCRIPTION:Join the Friends of Lake Monroe on Sunday September 13 to cel
 ebrate our 10th anniversary! Enjoy tapas from Segovia and live music from
  Frank Jones and the Undertones. New this year: take your picture at our 
 photo booth and try your luck at the wine pull where some bottles include
  bonus prizes. Hear updates on the work we do to protect the lake while y
 ou eat\, dance\, and party with fellow lake lovers. Tickets available at 
 www.friendsoflakemonroe.org/events-page/lake-monroe-day-2026-ten-year-ann
