SUMMARY: Always A Little Bit Tipsy
DESCRIPTION:The world premiere of Always a Little Bit Tipsy will take pla
 ce in Bloomington\, Indiana this September! Based on the topsy-turvy life
  of world-champion ballroom dancer and drag artist Tom Slater (a.k.a. Tip
 sy Teasedale) the all-new original musical\, Always a Little Bit Tipsy\, 
 explores survival\, masculinity\, and the healing power of drag. This is 
 a story about the violence of small shames\, the masks we build to surviv
 e\, and the radical act of becoming whole. Produced by After the Storm Pr
 oductions and YOUnique Studio.\n\nSeptember 18\, 19\, 24\, 25\, 26 at 7:3
 0pm\n\nSeptember 20 and 27 at 2:00pm\n\nInfo at http://afterthestormprodu
 ctions.com/tipsy\n\nTickets at http://afterthestorm.ludus.com\n\n
CATEGORIES:
