SUMMARY: Goosebumps The Musical: Phantom of the Auditorium
DESCRIPTION:Constellation Stage & Screen presents “Goosebumps The Musical
 : Phantom of the Auditorium ” on stage October 30th- November 15th at the
  Waldron Auditorium.\n\nGet ready for a frightfully fun adventure with Go
 osebumps The Musical\, based on the wildly popular books by R. L. Stine! 
 When Brooke and Zeke are cast in their school’s spooky new play\, The Pha
 ntom\, they start to wonder if the show is actually cursed. As strange me
 ssages appear and rehearsals are disrupted by a mysterious masked figure\
 , they must uncover the truth: is it all an elaborate prank… or is their 
 theater truly haunted? Full of catchy songs\, laugh-out-loud moments\, an
 d just the right amount of Halloween-season chills\, this musical mystery
  is perfect for kids\, tweens\, and grown-ups who remember reading by fla
 shlight. Fun for all ages!\n\nSee Constellation’s website for more inform
 ation\, including a detailed performance schedule. Learn more and find ti
 ckets at seeconstellation.org/kids/goosebumps/ https://seeconstellation.o
 rg/kids/goosebumps/
